  <section class="about-container">
    <h1>About DealLeft</h1>
    <p>
      DealLeft is a platform built to help sellers clear their leftover stock by offering products at discounted prices.
      Instead of letting items go to waste, we connect buyers and sellers to create value on both sides.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our goal is simple — <b>reduce waste, support small businesses, and help customers save money.</b>
    </p>

    <h2>Why We Started</h2>
    <p>
      Many businesses struggle with unsold inventory after seasonal sales, trends, or bulk production. 
      These products may be new but remain unused and often end up discarded. 
      DealLeft gives those products a second chance.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Vision</h2>
    <p>
      To create a sustainable shopping ecosystem where businesses reduce losses, customers save more,
      and environment benefits from reduced waste.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Team</h2>
    <ul class="team-list">
      <li>Samarth Agarwal</li>
      <li>Ronak Gupta</li>
      <li>Krishna Aditya Singh</li>
    </ul>

  </section>

